      "text": "```\n+--------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| MANDARIN CHINESE (普通话 Pǔtōnghuà / 國語 Guóyǔ)                   |\n+--------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Family:      Sino-Tibetan → Sinitic → Mandarin group              |\n| Native spkrs: ~920M                                               |\n| Total spkrs:  ~1.1B (L1+L2)                                       |\n| Countries:   PRC (official), Taiwan (official), Singapore (official)|\n|              Malaysia, diaspora worldwide                           |\n| Word order:  SVO                                                   |\n| Morphology:  Isolating — almost no inflection                     |\n| Tonal:       YES — 4 tones + neutral tone                         |\n| Gender:      None                                                  |\n| Script:      Chinese characters (Hanzi) + Pinyin romanization      |\n|              PRC: Simplified; Taiwan/diaspora: Traditional         |\n| Cases:       None                                                  |\n| FSI level:   Category IV — ~2200 hours (hardest for English)       |\n+--------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
